Here is the third maintenance release for the v2.1.x branch.  Short
log follows:

	[x86, powerpc, blackfin] Upgrade Adeos support.

	[nucleus] Do not force migration upon dormant threads.

	[native] Do not send SIGKILL to dormant threads upon
	termination.

	[posix] Rework shared memory allocation code.

Please see the ChangeLog for details.

